Z||000005||AusFiero||06-21-2001||05:53 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrgone:<BR><B>thanks.<P>that looks diffacult but ill give it a try</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I should have new indicator driving lights available within 2 weeks if that gets too hard. These are new driving lights with a second orange globe added inside the bucket to act as an indicator. Mount them in the stock location and wire up new wiring for the driving lamps. Found 1 good light but they ended up being too small. The quest is still on for the perfect size light.  Close jsut isnt good enough.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
